<title>USA: Trimark, Live, October eye tieup - report.</title>
<headline>Trimark, Live, October eye tieup - report.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Boston investment firm Bain Capital Partners is backing a tentative merger of Live Entertainment, Trimark Holdings and October Pictures, Daily Variety said.</p>
<p>A merger would create a $200 million company with a 2,400-title library and distribution base, it said.</p>
<p>Daily Variety said a deal was far from finished, partly because other buyers, such as Universal Pictures, were interested in October Pictures.</p>
<p>Trimark was not immediately available to comment.</p>
<p>((New York newsdesk 212-859-1610))</p>
</text>
